    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32017" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκ-θετος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sent out of the house, sent
				away,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				70
			</span></i> ; <i>exposed,</i> of a child, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				7.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				6.52
			</span></i> ; <i>cast away,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>projecting, salient,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.68
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρυπτός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i>(?)ap.<i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				49.4.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> neut.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκθετον, τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκθέτης</span>
			, Al.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ez.</u>
				42.3
			</span></i>.</div>
